  "description": "Marley is a half-baked witch struggling to make ends meet in the northern forest. When she captures a rare fairy named Prim, she plans to harvest his expensive \"essence\" and sell it for money. Unfortunately, Prim has never felt the urge to mate and doesn't know how to produce this ingredient, so Marley literally takes matters into her own hands. As they're navigating this awkward \"extraction\" process, a health scare and a desperate wish turn their transactional relationship into something much more intimate...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
